        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEbz0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACPUQAAkLhfNyxbYRt6+RV3fbkgU4\nFvHY9F10Xjt2OqN8MFTXr5865K9Lvn2z67M2Umjqngfkfa1LqPS8qMTGymeK0DDD\nXroaCY2uQ9qx36kSBlKvpVhmJErWgJoGDMKBHIPsTzIMBiPgHKjYMJ1EfK2hVHdb\nJcVZWTi688DnexEQGFQOyY1q43DMwHP4W3uGR2pqS2BF5+rHhSIAGjkgQCh4GZQd\nE+lHGoy2p2Z5qFVXkK/NPH7QpZYnwwVPoT3MHVvNrhXy5vVG+x2EScMhGOXYecMf\nQfUMb9CJgPmvykBp159dVyI+zBoXoVmhYMnrL4ANItMbVoslgr9TBJfrtjncylRS\nCJ+a43jXQ169qv0VJ+JpJ5sppvxsdB+BuVLT7PTyeJSz8Q9XnynS5S9vFCDsRn/n\nj+3VijvHurzMU1C/siCo1V4lsmKpem9H+EuyoSZHllblZIljbM2yRwdyPAzqmTzi\n+CqqKeb27zQxI/QTZV/Ef1DIEVQ2YTTraa4Z1nhV4npJaFEtDbFxCCvjjwPLWM3m\nO36+S8DgvJzHSb53KBSHP5SK4bJNMJ2dBjppe+kDUhz6hrYPts2quZBck6usuiv4\nhol7v7eUmFd1qmXbZzlN139uR/G55IiLn0hQBIORPBBVaU+j+V5dR6Y9VWwBXieQ\nY/iAkZmmttUSGVPEGDLK\n=9CAp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 378cbf4a73f4085c339352e050d531f0acd56808\nparent 0216b78d1f1df8bc40651ba3d2c1d965eff83197\nauthor Rob Woodgate <robwoodgate@users.noreply.github.com> 1779547380 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779547380 +0200\n\nfeat(nut06): add method_name to mint/melt method settings (NUT-04/05) (#672)\n\n* feat(nut06): add method_name to mint/melt method settings (NUT-04/05)\n\nNUT-04/05 add a `method_name` field to the method-unit settings the mint\nadvertises at /v1/info — a human-readable name for the method (e.g.\n\"Lightning\"). cashu-ts models both NUT-04 and NUT-05 settings with a single\n`SwapMethod` type, so one addition covers both.\n\nType it as `string | null` to match the existing `<x|null>` siblings\n(`min_amount`, `max_amount`): normalizeSwapMethods coerces an absent field to\nnull so MintInfo always returns a spec-valid response. Consumers fall back to\n`method` for display when null.\n\nPurely additive on a response type, so non-breaking.\n\n* test: expect coerced method_name in normalized mint-info\n\nnormalizeSwapMethods now coerces an absent method_name to null, so the\nisSupported(5) deep-equality expectation in the wallet init test gains\nmethod_name: null on each method-unit pair.",
